<h2>Dear {{company_name}} Team,</h2>

<p>An update has been issued for your employer registration request on the Even Cargo Portal.</p>

<div class="info-box">
  <p><strong>Company:</strong> {{company_name}}</p>
  <p><strong>Account Status:</strong> <span class="badge {{#if approved}}badge-success{{else}}badge-danger{{/if}}">{{status}}</span></p>
  {{#if rejection_reason}}
  <p><strong>Notes / Reason:</strong> {{rejection_reason}}</p>
  {{/if}}
</div>

{{#if approved}}
<p>Congratulations! Your employer account is fully activated. You can now post apprenticeship positions, review candidate profiles, and manage NAPS compliance.</p>
{{else}}
<p>Please log in to update the required compliance documents or contact support for assistance.</p>
{{/if}}

<p>Best regards,<br><strong>The Even Cargo Team</strong></p>
